              "name": "Bad Request - The file upload request is malformed or invalid. Returns `failure_in_attachment_handling` when the 'file' field is missing or contains no file data. Returns `INVALID_REQUEST` when request constraints are violated, such as exceeding the 10-file limit per request.",
